---
description: ViralKit product and integration guidelines
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

ViralKit is referral infrastructure for apps on Monad. Its current deployment is Monad Testnet (chain ID 10143).

- Preserve the deployed ReferralHub address and all verified contract behavior. Do not redeploy or change contract logic without explicit approval.
- Keep wallet, checkout, AUSD payment splitting, referral attribution, SDK, and Envio indexing flows intact.
- Read balances, campaign terms, earnings, and purchase activity from Monad Testnet contracts or the configured Envio GraphQL endpoint. Never add fabricated data or success states.
- Label testnet transactions and assets clearly; they have no real-world value.
- Keep credentials in ignored environment files. Never commit private keys, seed phrases, or tokens.
- Keep sample product flows under `/examples`; maintain the shared product navigation and responsive ViralKit visual system.
- Run relevant type checks and tests after code changes, and report checks that could not be completed.
